<title>USA: Markel seeks NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Markel seeks NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Markel Corp said on Tuesday that the company has applied for listing of its common stock on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company anticipates that its shares will begin trading on the NYSE in June under the symbol &quot;MKL,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Markel Corp has approximately 5.5 million shares outstanding and a market capitalization of over $600 million, the company said.</p>
